<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  Password updated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Security confirmation
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  This is a confirmation that the password for your Dukka account <strong>{{email}}</strong> was changed successfully. You can continue signing in with your new credentials right away.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Account" value=email}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Password changed"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Wasn't you?"}}
  If you did not make this change, reset your password immediately and contact Dukka support. Someone may have gained access to your account.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks for helping us keep your account secure.
</p>
